        <h2 id="plug-view-heading">Where does the wire connect?</h2>
        <p>These are enlarged views looking straight into the open end of each cable plug, with its cable pointing away from you. A and B name the two rows of metal contacts; the numbers identify their positions.</p>
        <p id="plug-view-status" aria-live="polite">Choose a wire to see the contacts it joins highlighted in blue.</p>
